 "remarks": "Location, opportunity, and endless potential in the heart of Shippan Point. Just a short stroll from Long Island Sound, this 2,600 square foot home sits on a 0.36 acre lot and is ready for its next chapter. Featuring a welcoming front porch, hardwood floors, and a detached two car garage, this is a wonderful opportunity to renovate and create the home you have always wanted in one of Stamford's most sought after waterfront neighborhoods. Enjoy the best of Shippan Point while remaining just minutes from the train station, downtown Stamford, and local shopping. Bring your vision and make it your own. Home is an estate sale and is being sold as is. Please submit highest and best offers by noon on Tuesday the 22nd.",
